Repeat the same pattern in `button.config.js` immediately after each of these existing “--small” entries for the `secondary`, `tertiary`, `danger`, and `ghost` variants so that all four color‐scales gain both “large” and “xl” stories.  

With just these edits in place, you will have two new size keywords supported end-to-end:  
– `<Button size="large" …/>` yields a 64px/8rem height button;  
– `<Button size="xl" …/>` yields an 80px/10rem height button.
